AL=true bypass allowlist but still requires --confirm+TTY and is audited (reason logged). Wildcard * explicitly allows any. Fingerprint SHA256 entries fail-closed (string compare only, no fingerprint source) - documented gap LOW.","CI spoof MEDIUM open: IsCI checks CI/GITHUB_ACTIONS/GITLAB_CI/CIRCLECI/JENKINS_URL etc any non-empty -\u003e true; local export CI=true skips allowlist+prompt -\u003e prod deploy with only --confirm. Design-intentional break-glass, audited 0600 HMAC, but no cryptographic CI attestation. Recommend future job token/oidc.","Audit HMAC chain: HMAC-SHA256 over canonical JSON without Hash field, prev_hash chaining, O_APPEND|O_SYNC 0600, key 32B rand hex 0600 or ANVIL_AUDIT_HMAC_KEY (hex or raw-\u003esha256). VerifyChain detects hash mismatch; redaction via SanitizeLogLine+RedactSecrets on remotePath/details/user; no allowlist leak. Truncation MEDIUM open: deleting last N lines still verifies, no external anchor/counter. Recommend forward to SIEM + periodic hash snapshot.","Redaction+HMAC key: All deploy errors SanitizeLogLine, DeployUser bound to SSH principal not spoofable string, key file 0600, audit.log 0600, env key persisted hex 0600, Chmod self-heal. TestAudit redacts DEPLOY_SSH_KEY/private/begin open to ***REDACTED***.","Verdict: PASS (approve) - 3 HIGH fixes verified, no HIGH residual. Residuals MEDIUM truncation+CI-spoof, Lows framework-free prod legacy, fingerprint, env allowlist. Go tests Guard/Audit/ProdLive PASS (7/7), config ProdLive PASS, vet PASS, guard_recommendation.md updated AC3. Resolved note.","Next: 1) Add CI attestation token 2) Audit external anchor 3) Remove framework-free prod allowance after migration 4) Wire fingerprint from transport when available"],"role":"review","verdict":"approve"}